# Triple-quoted interpolated strings desugar to [unindent [tmpl ...]]
i"""
  Dear $name,
  Your order #$order-id is ready.
  """
=== out
[unindent [call tmpl "\n  Dear $name,\n  Your order #$order-id is ready.\n  "]]

=== warn
undefined variable: name at 1:1-1:1
undefined variable: order-id at 1:1-1:1
